00:26:45.720 --> 00:26:48.300
Le responsable approuve,

00:26:48.540 --> 00:26:49.240
le flux est publié

00:26:49.240 --> 00:26:49.940
en silver et queue

00:26:49.940 --> 00:26:51.500
