00:26:51.500 --> 00:26:52.600
demeure inchangée.

00:26:53.240 --> 00:26:53.700
Pas de drame,

00:26:53.920 --> 00:26:55.000
juste un entretien utile.

00:26:56.380 --> 00:26:56.660
Enfin,

00:26:56.760 --> 00:26:57.420
les bilans de santé.

00:26:58.060 --> 00:26:58.680
Copilot audite

00:26:58.680 --> 00:26:59.220
